a. Raising of capital through a Qualified Institutions Placement for an aggregate amount not exceeding Rs. 11,700 Crore &lt;BR&gt; 
b. Preferential issue of warrants convertible into equivalent number of Equity Shares for an aggregate amount not exceeding Rs. 5,800 Crore &lt;BR&gt; 
  &lt;BR&gt; 
2. The Shareholders at their meeting held on 2 November 2026 has approved the above mentioned issues and the results of the said meeting was informed to the exchanges on 4 November 2026 by way of Scrutiniser Report. &lt;BR&gt; 
  &lt;BR&gt; 
3. Further, this is an Outcome of QIP 2026- Allotment Committee for issuance of equity shares . The Company has already filed an outcome for the Board meeting held on 1 October 2026 wherein the Board had approved the issuance of equity shares through QIP.</in-capmkt:RemarksWebsiteDisseminationForAllotmentOfSecurities></xbrli:xbrl>
